WEBVTT

00:00.025 --> 00:29.932
Fortunes & Misfortunes of a False Mother & Son

00:01.727 --> 00:03.394
The love and sorrow of a false mother and son.

00:04.174 --> 00:09.148
I finally have the ideal family I've always wanted.

00:09.686 --> 00:11.499
A man pretending to be another woman's son

00:11.553 --> 00:14.513
feels more loved by his false mother
than by his real family.

00:14.959 --> 00:17.293
Give me a facelift; into this face.

00:17.318 --> 00:18.962
You can look like anyone you want.

00:19.089 --> 00:20.242
Please stop!

00:20.402 --> 00:22.675
Were things going well with that mother?

00:22.768 --> 00:24.596
There's something I must tell you.

00:25.002 --> 00:25.682
I'm...

00:25.829 --> 00:29.933
Black Jack, Today's Karte - Fortunes & Misfortunes of a False Mother & Son.

00:29.995 --> 00:36.618
I'm going to fly to where you are.

00:29.995 --> 00:36.618
kimi no moto e tonde yuku yo

00:36.953 --> 00:43.959
I know I can spread my wings when I want to see you.

00:36.953 --> 00:43.959
aitai toki tsubasa hiraku

00:44.544 --> 00:47.629
Nobody knows

00:44.544 --> 00:47.629
dara nimo wakaranai

00:48.048 --> 00:51.467
when a miracle might occur,

00:48.048 --> 00:51.467
kiseki wa itsu okiru?

00:51.468 --> 00:57.890
but it feels like my wish is finally coming true.

00:51.468 --> 00:57.890
nozomi wa kanaeraresou de

00:57.891 --> 01:04.688
Because there's only one place I want to go,

00:57.891 --> 01:04.688
mukau basho wa hitotsu shika nai kara

01:04.689 --> 01:07.941
iro asenai omoi yosete

01:04.689 --> 01:07.941
I gather my feelings whose colors never fade,

01:07.942 --> 01:11.487
and now it seems I'm dreaming.

01:07.942 --> 01:11.487
saa Dreaming now

01:12.072 --> 01:15.407
I'm living for your sake?

01:12.072 --> 01:15.407
kimi no tame ni iketeru

01:15.408 --> 01:18.577
I will be your strength,

01:15.408 --> 01:18.577
donna chikara nimo naru

01:18.870 --> 01:21.789
no matter how far apart we are.

01:18.870 --> 01:21.789
Far away Far away harukana

01:21.790 --> 01:25.584
So Freedom. So Freedom.

01:25.710 --> 01:29.171
I will send you

01:25.710 --> 01:29.171
kimi no tame no okurou

01:29.172 --> 01:32.424
the beautiful blossom of this flower.

01:29.172 --> 01:32.424
kirei ni saita hana wo

01:32.592 --> 01:35.511
So let's look for shooting stars.

01:32.592 --> 01:35.511
Shooting Star Shooting Star sagasou

01:35.512 --> 01:39.515
So Freedom. So Freedom.

02:11.877 --> 02:14.504
Anyway, you sure are something,

02:14.505 --> 02:17.156
wanting to cross the desert on camel back.

02:17.424 --> 02:19.424
You've gotta use camels in the desert.

02:19.927 --> 02:22.220
It's too boring traveling in a car.

02:22.221 --> 02:26.766
Which is why I agreed to pay you such
an exorbitant fee to be my guide.

02:26.767 --> 02:28.612
Well, sure.

02:36.525 --> 02:39.014
<i>Research for constructing a pipeline, huh...</i>

02:39.279 --> 02:43.116
<i>And I think he mentioned that he's heir
to some large company in Japan.</i>

02:44.409 --> 02:45.785
All right, that's enough for this spot.

02:45.786 --> 02:46.577
Let's move on.

02:48.038 --> 02:51.144
Say, why did you start this business?

02:52.167 --> 02:55.721
People have told me I'm good at looking after others, so...

02:56.004 --> 02:58.214
<i>To make a living, of course!</i>

02:58.215 --> 02:59.293
I see.

02:59.550 --> 03:01.717
It's best if you're good at it.

03:01.718 --> 03:03.722
You shouldn't keep a job you hate.

03:04.388 --> 03:05.388
<i>Rich snob.</i>

03:05.389 --> 03:08.015
<i>I'm not in a position where I can pick any job.</i>

03:09.835 --> 03:12.562
Sir, be careful around here.

03:12.563 --> 03:14.647
The ground is not firm in this area.

03:23.866 --> 03:24.407
Sir!

03:32.124 --> 03:33.221
Sir!

03:36.127 --> 03:37.023
Sir!

03:40.090 --> 03:42.049
What an unlucky man.

03:43.427 --> 03:48.014
I don't care if you die, I'm still collecting my fee.

03:53.020 --> 03:55.396
He's carrying so much money on him.

03:56.398 --> 03:57.273
What's this?

03:58.108 --> 03:59.400
It's his passport.

04:01.361 --> 04:05.323
<i>This might be a sign from God or the Devil.</i>

04:05.782 --> 04:07.742
<i>He's an elite white collar worker from Japan,</i>

04:07.743 --> 04:11.118
<i>bat I'm just a poor man from the slums.</i>

04:11.538 --> 04:15.499
<i>It's very unlikely that his body will
be discovered around here.</i>

04:16.752 --> 04:20.504
I'll put this money and passport to good use.

04:26.762 --> 04:29.972
Originally "A Fortunate Man" by Tezuka Osamu

04:26.762 --> 04:29.972
Fortunes & Misfortunes of a False Mother & Son

04:29.973 --> 04:34.185
A Japanese engineer, Ichiro Tendoh, is still missing.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.105
Come in.

04:42.694 --> 04:44.695
Are you Dr. Black Jack?

04:44.696 --> 04:46.572
It's an honor to have you here.

04:49.342 --> 04:53.996
You will perform any surgery as long as you get paid, right?

04:53.997 --> 04:55.402
No questions asked?

04:55.624 --> 04:58.000
Yes, as long as I get paid.

04:58.297 --> 05:00.529
I'm relieved to hear that.

05:00.837 --> 05:03.714
You are exactly as I've heard.

05:04.174 --> 05:05.566
Let me hear your request.

05:06.009 --> 05:07.459
Allow me to get straight to the point.

05:07.761 --> 05:09.720
I want a facelift

05:09.954 --> 05:10.972
to look Japanese.

05:11.419 --> 05:12.459
To this face.

05:15.394 --> 05:20.116
Can I look like a Japanese man with surgery?

05:20.691 --> 05:22.483
It is possible.

05:22.484 --> 05:24.944
You can look like anyone you want.

05:24.945 --> 05:27.571
Will this cover your fee?

05:29.616 --> 05:30.533
Very well.

05:31.493 --> 05:32.743
Are you sure about this?

05:32.744 --> 05:36.038
I thought you don't ask for reasons, Doctor?

05:36.623 --> 05:38.291
Don't hold me responsible for anything.

05:38.875 --> 05:41.178
<i>Like me not being able to speak Japanese?</i>

05:41.420 --> 05:46.919
<i>I'll just pretend that I lost my
ability to speak due to shock.</i>

05:51.930 --> 05:53.556
I'm commencing the operation.

06:04.818 --> 06:05.763
This is...

06:06.355 --> 06:08.378
Are you satisfied?

06:08.673 --> 06:10.075
Yes, I am.

06:10.075 --> 06:11.449
Very satisfied.

06:11.875 --> 06:15.073
I'm sure I don't need to tell you,
but forget everything that S happened here.

06:15.370 --> 06:17.413
Don't ever tell anyone about this.

06:17.414 --> 06:18.434
I know.

06:18.832 --> 06:21.616
I want to stay out of any trouble too.

06:21.877 --> 06:22.502
Bye.

06:28.492 --> 06:34.552
Ichiro Tendoh, who has been missing and was suspected
of having been involved in some sort of accident,

06:34.645 --> 06:37.045
has returned home after half a year.

06:37.784 --> 06:42.458
According to Mr. Tendoh, he has no memory of the
accident and has been wandering around various places.

06:43.192 --> 06:48.152
<i>For the past half-year, I've made a desperate
attempt to become Tendoh.</i>

06:48.653 --> 06:54.950
<i>I learned his handwriting, as well as
Japanese culture and language.</i>

06:55.786 --> 06:59.413
<i>Now I'll have everything he had.</i>

07:03.608 --> 07:05.285
Ichiro!

07:07.422 --> 07:09.423
<i>There's Tendoh's mother.</i>

07:09.424 --> 07:11.441
<i>This one will be tough.</i>

07:11.802 --> 07:14.095
<i>Starting with his mother, no less.</i>

07:14.096 --> 07:16.305
Thank goodness! You're safe!

07:16.306 --> 07:17.556
I'm your mom.

07:22.590 --> 07:23.350
Ichiro?

07:23.530 --> 07:24.241
Ichiro?!

07:24.648 --> 07:26.148
You can't talk?

07:26.149 --> 07:27.793
Poor boy.

07:28.110 --> 07:31.098
But I'm still glad you're alive.

07:31.363 --> 07:34.231
Let me see your face.

07:35.909 --> 07:37.910
It's really you!

07:37.911 --> 07:43.082
You were out of the country for such a long time,
but you haven't changed a bit.

07:43.248 --> 07:47.044
<i>Good. Looks like I can trick her, all right.</i>

07:47.504 --> 07:52.007
I was so lonely while you were gone.

07:52.008 --> 07:54.009
I was at a loss as to what to do alone.

07:54.010 --> 07:56.105
You know, your company...

07:56.346 --> 07:57.304
<i>The company?</i>

07:58.056 --> 07:59.768
It went bankrupt.

08:00.121 --> 08:01.728
You didn't know?

08:02.234 --> 08:03.323
<i>What?!</i>

08:03.603 --> 08:09.847
And the guarantor of the debt, also the co-manager,
disappeared after spending the loan.

08:10.487 --> 08:14.005
We had to give up the house;
now we're penniless.

08:14.030 --> 08:15.531
And we have no relatives.

08:15.532 --> 08:18.033
I didn't know how to make ends meet.

08:19.244 --> 08:22.288
That's when you came home.

08:22.289 --> 08:23.998
I'm so glad.

08:23.999 --> 08:27.126
Thank you, Ichiro.

08:28.634 --> 08:31.213
<i>What the heck's going on?!</i>

08:33.388 --> 08:35.718
Rest up well for a while.

08:35.719 --> 08:38.888
We can think about what to do after that.

08:38.889 --> 08:40.637
<i>What a big joke!</i>

08:40.891 --> 08:43.934
<i>I didn't come to Japan to suffer like this!</i>

08:45.071 --> 08:48.189
<i>I was planning to take Tendoh's savings and properties,</i>

08:48.190 --> 08:51.150
<i>but the only thing I got was an unwanted burden!</i>

08:51.151 --> 08:52.919
This isn't funny at all!

08:55.822 --> 08:58.782
<i>Luckily, that doctor is supposed to be living in Japan.</i>

08:58.783 --> 09:00.868
<i>I'll go talk to him directly.</i>

09:02.120 --> 09:03.537
<i>Dang it!</i>

09:03.538 --> 09:06.272
<i>I even have to save money for a car!</i>

09:06.583 --> 09:07.875
Coming!

09:08.919 --> 09:11.274
Hello. Who are you?

09:11.671 --> 09:13.677
Is Dr. Black Jack home?

09:14.216 --> 09:16.419
Hey, Doctor, thanks for the last.job.

09:16.639 --> 09:19.136
You haven't forgotten me, right?

09:19.137 --> 09:21.096
Who's this?

09:21.386 --> 09:24.033
Sorry for the trouble, but I don't need this face anymore.

09:24.309 --> 09:27.937
And because I have this face, I got in trouble.

09:27.938 --> 09:30.648
Please! I want change back to my original face!

09:31.066 --> 09:32.488
Change me back!

09:34.778 --> 09:36.437
I don't know you.

09:37.983 --> 09:41.019
And even if I had any business with you before,

09:41.243 --> 09:44.036
I don't remember every case from the past.

09:44.037 --> 09:47.122
Oh, so you really don't know him.

09:47.123 --> 09:49.500
Don't give me the cold shoulder, Doctor!

09:49.501 --> 09:51.710
You forgot about the surgery you performed on this face?!

09:51.711 --> 09:53.629
That doesn't matter at all.

09:53.630 --> 09:56.509
If you want a facelift, bring me money.

09:57.384 --> 10:00.511
As long as you pay me, I'll operate on you.

10:01.635 --> 10:03.922
No questions asked, of course.

10:10.870 --> 10:13.421
<i>I wouldn't be suffering if I had money!</i>

10:13.900 --> 10:14.867
<i>Damn!</i>

10:15.083 --> 10:16.193
<i>I'll get you back!</i>

10:18.405 --> 10:21.114
I'm sorry for such a modest dinner.

10:21.449 --> 10:24.952
This is the best I can give you for now.

10:28.314 --> 10:30.048
Eat a lot.

10:34.045 --> 10:36.213
I made your bed.

10:39.009 --> 10:40.426
<i>That annoying old woman!</i>

10:40.427 --> 10:42.059
<i>Trying to act nice!</i>

10:42.804 --> 10:47.766
<i>She's just a stranger, so I'll suck
everything I can out of her.</i>

10:47.767 --> 10:49.935
<i>I'll use her and dump her!</i>

10:59.874 --> 11:02.430
<i>My mother was evil.</i>

11:03.158 --> 11:07.161
<i>She enslaved me when I was young,
and slapped me a lot as I grew up.</i>

11:07.954 --> 11:09.788
<i>She used me like a tool.</i>

11:10.832 --> 11:14.752
<i>I couldn't believe anything about what
people called "motherly love".</i>

11:15.587 --> 11:17.250
<i>She was mean and greedy.</i>

11:17.672 --> 11:20.424
<i>She took away everything I earned,</i>

11:20.425 --> 11:22.146
<i>and she never gave anything to me.</i>

11:25.959 --> 11:28.695
<i>I don't believe in any motherly being.</i>

11:29.142 --> 11:32.360
<i>There's no way I'll look after a.stranger.</i>

11:32.979 --> 11:34.480
<i>I'm just me.</i>

11:34.481 --> 11:36.774
<i>I'll just worry about my own living.</i>

11:37.734 --> 11:41.487
<i>This country is much richer than mine.</i>

11:41.488 --> 11:43.891
<i>At least I've lucked out there.</i>

11:58.254 --> 11:59.838
Hey, Ichiro,

12:00.768 --> 12:02.285
I made this.

12:02.592 --> 12:03.634
Try it on.

12:05.854 --> 12:07.596
It looks good on you.

12:08.375 --> 12:09.495
<i>This is great.</i>

12:13.561 --> 12:15.979
<i>Yeah, you are a good person,</i>

12:16.606 --> 12:18.528
<i>but I won't give you any money.</i>

12:21.945 --> 12:23.652
This is my money!

12:29.265 --> 12:32.746
Hey granny, what the hell do you think you're doing here?

12:32.747 --> 12:34.930
Oh, I was just...

12:41.965 --> 12:45.634
Hey granny, what the hell do you think you're doing here?

12:45.849 --> 12:46.947
<i>That's...</i>

12:47.619 --> 12:50.556
Who gave you permission to do business here, huh?!

12:50.557 --> 12:54.560
I just wanted to help my family however I can.

12:54.561 --> 12:56.979
That's not what I asked!

12:56.980 --> 13:00.691
You need to pay up before you can sell anything here!

13:00.692 --> 13:04.585
That's the rule. It's not our fault.

13:05.530 --> 13:06.363
Oh no!

13:06.364 --> 13:07.448
Please stop!

13:07.449 --> 13:08.840
Don't get in my way!

13:10.660 --> 13:12.786
Come on!

13:14.831 --> 13:15.748
Take that!

13:20.837 --> 13:22.087
Oh, welcome home.

13:22.088 --> 13:25.048
I'm sorry. I'll get the table ready now.

13:46.654 --> 13:47.946
<i>I'm...</i>

13:56.400 --> 13:57.224
What's this?

13:57.600 --> 13:58.736
It's a present,

14:00.627 --> 14:01.391
Mom.

14:02.053 --> 14:03.295
Ichiro!

14:04.013 --> 14:06.527
Did you just talk?

14:06.766 --> 14:08.746
You can talk again?

14:09.223 --> 14:10.317
Go ahead and open it.

14:10.776 --> 14:11.932
Ichiro!

14:12.138 --> 14:15.250
Would you call me "Mom" again?

14:16.059 --> 14:17.230
Mom...

14:19.687 --> 14:22.022
Mom.

14:23.399 --> 14:24.563
Thank heavens!

14:24.910 --> 14:26.270
This is so great!

14:27.496 --> 14:29.071
Everything is all right now.

14:29.072 --> 14:34.877
The company went bust, but I'll
earn enough for the two of us.

14:37.038 --> 14:39.320
There's nothing for you to worry about.

14:40.375 --> 14:41.917
Ichiro!

14:43.488 --> 14:44.709
<i>That's right.</i>

14:45.421 --> 14:48.549
<i>I need to at least earn our living.</i>

14:50.927 --> 14:53.554
Hey Tendoh, wanna go out for a drink tonight?

14:53.815 --> 14:56.515
Sorry, but I need to stop drinking for a while.

14:59.310 --> 15:04.374
<i>I finally have the ideal family I've always wanted!</i>

15:04.858 --> 15:06.186
<i>A real family!</i>

15:20.164 --> 15:24.827
It's really been a long time since we've been out together.

15:31.676 --> 15:36.972
<i>I'm deceiving such a nice person.
Pretending to be her son...</i>

15:39.350 --> 15:40.350
What's the matter?

15:40.351 --> 15:42.144
You're awfully quiet.

15:42.145 --> 15:45.522
It's nothing. Really.

15:47.984 --> 15:51.153
Excuse me, can you do us a favor?

15:51.154 --> 15:52.208
Press here.

15:58.620 --> 15:59.912
This is me?

15:59.913 --> 16:01.580
It is.

16:01.744 --> 16:04.583
You were such a mischief-maker back then.

16:06.210 --> 16:07.711
And this is Mom.

16:09.047 --> 16:11.270
<i>Tendoh seems to have received lots of love.</i>

16:12.634 --> 16:14.662
Mom, is there more?

16:15.553 --> 16:17.942
Any more memories between us.

16:20.127 --> 16:21.016
Huh?

16:24.235 --> 16:25.235
Dentures?

16:25.688 --> 16:26.732
Your denture?

16:27.649 --> 16:28.578
That's weird.

16:28.858 --> 16:30.854
You have good teeth.

16:31.486 --> 16:32.522
Hey, Mo—

16:33.071 --> 16:35.121
Mom! Where are you going?

16:35.365 --> 16:37.378
Mom! Mom!

16:40.119 --> 16:44.164
<i>She'll get sick if she goes out without
dressing warmly when it's so cold.</i>

16:48.086 --> 16:49.628
Mom! Mom!

16:56.094 --> 16:57.970
<i>Where has she gone?</i>

17:02.475 --> 17:03.684
Mom?

17:03.685 --> 17:04.893
Mom!

17:10.959 --> 17:12.607
Where's my mother?!

17:12.986 --> 17:14.956
She came here too late.

17:15.321 --> 17:17.030
She has a critical case of pneumonia.

17:17.031 --> 17:18.573
You better heal her!

17:18.574 --> 17:22.452
We will do our best, but it might be too late already.

17:22.453 --> 17:24.559
It seems she was pushing herself a lot,

17:24.914 --> 17:26.561
and we have to consider her age too.

17:30.086 --> 17:32.232
Doctor! Please save Mom!

17:32.463 --> 17:35.215
They told me she has an acute case of pneumonia,
and that she's in critical condition!

17:35.216 --> 17:36.754
You took her to a hospital?

17:37.385 --> 17:39.068
And she also has a pulmonary embolism?

17:39.345 --> 17:40.637
That's not good.

17:40.638 --> 17:43.140
You're the only one who can save her!

17:43.185 --> 17:43.951
So please!

17:43.975 --> 17:46.059
Were things going well with that mother?

17:47.520 --> 17:50.856
Were things going well between that mother and you?

17:50.857 --> 17:52.427
Of course.

17:52.817 --> 17:55.277
She's my priceless mother.

17:55.278 --> 17:57.029
She's my only family!

17:57.030 --> 17:59.239
I'll come up with the money,
even if it takes me my whole life!

17:59.408 --> 18:00.449
Please!

18:00.450 --> 18:02.075
Please save Mom!

18:04.203 --> 18:06.729
All right, I'm on my way.

18:13.629 --> 18:15.279
<i>She's in severe condition.</i>

18:15.798 --> 18:18.319
<i>I'm not sure if she can endure an operation.</i>

18:20.386 --> 18:22.262
All right, I'll operate on her immediately.

18:22.263 --> 18:24.019
There's no need.

18:25.224 --> 18:28.602
I knew my own body better than anyone.

18:29.187 --> 18:30.597
I'm no longer...

18:30.813 --> 18:34.066
But it's still not 100% hopeless.

18:34.236 --> 18:35.484
It's OK.

18:35.485 --> 18:38.028
I'm sure I'm suffering for my own misdeeds.

18:38.946 --> 18:42.407
But Doctor, please call Ichiro here.

18:45.620 --> 18:47.785
<i>I can't hide anything from her.</i>

18:48.247 --> 18:49.987
<i>I'll tell her everything.</i>

18:50.374 --> 18:52.709
<i>That I'm not her son.</i>

18:54.879 --> 18:56.177
D-Doctor!

18:56.672 --> 18:58.659
She said she wants to talk to you.

19:02.167 --> 19:02.912
Mom.

19:04.440 --> 19:08.141
Ichiro, I'm not going to make it.

19:08.518 --> 19:09.938
Don't say that.

19:10.186 --> 19:12.800
Come on, I know you'll make it through this!

19:13.731 --> 19:18.157
There is something I really want to
tell you while I'm still conscious.

19:18.653 --> 19:20.191
Me too.

19:20.571 --> 19:21.279
I'm actually—

19:21.442 --> 19:27.869
Ichiro, I'm not actually your real mother.

19:30.289 --> 19:34.000
Your real mother passed away a year ago.

19:34.001 --> 19:36.621
I'm a total stranger.

19:36.797 --> 19:39.047
B-But...

19:40.341 --> 19:42.609
I was a bad woman.

19:43.803 --> 19:49.343
I wanted the Tendoh estate's wealth
and pretended to be the mistress.

19:49.767 --> 19:54.688
I was once a live-in housekeeper at the Tendoh residence.

19:55.356 --> 19:58.358
I pretended to be the mistress when
she passed away suddenly,

19:58.359 --> 20:02.696
so I acquired her house and wealth
as if nothing had ever happened.

20:03.156 --> 20:05.907
But when the company went bankrupt,

20:05.908 --> 20:09.035
both the house and money were taken away from me.

20:11.122 --> 20:14.749
And I couldn't say that I wasn't
Mrs. Tendoh anymore at that point.

20:14.750 --> 20:18.378
I had no choice but to depend on you.

20:19.505 --> 20:22.313
But your face is...

20:22.832 --> 20:26.928
I had my face lifted to look like your mother's face

20:26.929 --> 20:28.347
by Dr. Black Jack.

20:29.182 --> 20:30.515
Black Jack?!

20:30.516 --> 20:33.018
T-Then, does he...

20:33.436 --> 20:40.172
I was worried sick everyday that you might find out.

20:41.152 --> 20:43.669
But you never noticed.

20:44.405 --> 20:48.742
Not only that, you've always been a good son.

20:48.743 --> 20:51.409
I never had any children,

20:51.662 --> 20:57.626
so as we lived together, you started to feel like a real son.

20:58.252 --> 21:00.527
Please forgive me for deceiving you,

21:01.005 --> 21:05.050
but I've never experienced such happiness before.

21:05.051 --> 21:05.901
Mom!

21:06.219 --> 21:08.428
Mom, I need to tell you something too!

21:08.724 --> 21:11.806
You'll still call me "Mom"?

21:12.808 --> 21:14.179
I'm happy.

21:14.624 --> 21:17.145
Mom! Mom!

21:17.146 --> 21:18.855
I'll call you "Mom" many, many times!

21:19.357 --> 21:23.360
So please! Please stay with me for a long time to come!

21:31.452 --> 21:33.286
Mom!

21:38.919 --> 21:41.272
International Airport

21:41.796 --> 21:44.494
I'm going to go back to my country and restart my life.

21:44.840 --> 21:46.998
I won't bother you anymore.

21:47.385 --> 21:48.378
Yeah?

21:48.678 --> 21:50.921
Not that it's any of my business...

21:52.056 --> 21:54.307
I guess we ask each other no questions, huh?

21:54.610 --> 21:56.445
Thanks for your help Doctor.

22:01.691 --> 22:05.944
So, Doc, who exactly was he?

22:05.945 --> 22:06.994
Who knows?

22:07.446 --> 22:09.777
The deal was not to ask him any questions.

22:24.018 --> 22:29.130
As you look at the ground uncertainly,

22:24.018 --> 22:29.130
tamerai gachi no fuseta hitomi

22:29.131 --> 22:34.427
I gently pull your hair closer to me.

22:29.131 --> 22:34.427
kono te ga sono kami hikiyoseteta

22:35.058 --> 22:41.559
You didn't speak, but only sighed,

22:35.058 --> 22:41.559
nani mo iezu ni kobore ochita tameiki

22:41.560 --> 22:46.022
and wet my chest with your tears.

22:41.560 --> 22:46.022
namida ga mune wo nurashita

22:46.023 --> 22:51.277
You longed to hear it, even if it was a lie.

22:46.023 --> 22:51.277
use demo ii... to kitto nozonde ita

22:51.278 --> 22:56.032
But I couldn't give you the answer you wanted.

22:51.278 --> 22:56.032
kimi no kimochi ni kotae kirezu

22:56.033 --> 23:04.457
If I gave you that answer, despite my cowardice,

22:56.033 --> 23:04.457
okubyou na boku ga moshi sono toki kotaetetara mada

23:04.458 --> 23:08.044
would we still be together?

23:04.458 --> 23:08.044
tsuzuiteita noka?

23:08.045 --> 23:13.341
That irregular breath my body was accustomed to,

23:08.045 --> 23:13.341
karada ga oboeta fukisoku na breath

23:13.345 --> 23:18.805
I want to feel it one more time.

23:13.345 --> 23:18.805
mou ichido subete de kanjitai

23:18.806 --> 23:24.310
The breath of surprise when I lost everything.

23:18.806 --> 23:24.310
subete wo nakushita fuyoui na breath

23:24.311 --> 23:33.486
And the pain that binds me every time I feel regret.

23:24.311 --> 23:33.486
kuyamu tabi mata sono itami ga shimetsukeru

23:45.002 --> 24:15.031
The Platform of Life

23:46.095 --> 23:47.955
A beautiful woman and her rollercoaster life.

23:48.089 --> 23:50.096
The story of an angelic miracle of happiness

23:50.155 --> 23:52.489
starts on a train station platform.

23:53.309 --> 23:54.342
I'll borrow this desk.

23:54.555 --> 23:56.415
But the ambulance will be here in five minutes!

23:56.662 --> 23:58.649
The patient will be dead by then!

23:58.874 --> 24:01.070
I didn't have any money that night,

24:01.213 --> 24:02.786
but now I can pay however much you ask.

24:03.026 --> 24:06.878
I'd reject every payment from you,
even one as small as a bowl of ramen.

24:07.087 --> 24:10.935
That girl didn't look happy.

24:11.262 --> 24:14.754
Black Jack, Next Karte - The Platform of Life

24:16.075 --> 24:17.689
Karte NG.

24:20.996 --> 24:22.147
It looks good on you.
